  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1202.39 Noncontact cooling water",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1202.39 “Noncontact cooling water” means water used for cooling that does not come into direct contact with any raw material, intermediate product, waste product, or finished product.\n\nSource. #8235, eff 12-22-04 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1200) (formerly Env-Ws 1202.39); ss by #9798-A, eff 10-9-10; ss by #12739, eff 3-19-19",
